      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:5:3:190:40",
      "text": [
        " الرَّجُلِ تَكُونُ عِنْدَهُ الْمَرْأَةُ فَيَتَزَوَّجُ أُخْرَى كَمْ يَجْعَلُ لِلَّتِي يَدْخُلُ بِهَا قَالَ ثَلَاثَةَ أَيَّامٍ ثُمَّ يَقْسِمُ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Al Husayn Bin Muhammad, from Moalla Bin Muhammad, from Al Hassan Bin Ali, from Aban, from Abdul Rahman Bin Abu Abdullah, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> regarding the man who happened to have a wife with him, so he married another, how much time should he make for copulation with her? So he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Three days, then he should divide (between the two)’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "40. Al-Husayn from Muhammad has narrated from Mu’alla’ ibn Muhammad from al-Hassan ibn Ali from Aban from Ibrahim ibn abu ‘Abd Allah who has said the following: “About the case of a man who marries a second wife and the amount of time for the new wife, abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘It (the time) is three days; thereafter he divides it between the two.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
